╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is Position ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ flow-measure MeasureResult
    - child Box
    - query MeasureQuery

if natural.outer-size.height > resting.outer-size.height then resting else natural

.. natural = child.measure(query)
.. block = query.block
.. resting = child.measure
    - MeasureQuery
        - query.inline
        - AxisQuery(AxisMeasureMode.min-content, block.min, block.available, block.max)

────────────────────
+ do settle
    - parent Box
    - child Box

. outer = child.outer-bounds
. natural = child.measure(parent.child-layout-query()).outer-size.height
. extra = natural - outer.height
=? if extra <= 0
. lift = extra * (child.$align-y?.fraction ?? 0%%)
child.arrange-outer-bounds(Rect(outer.x, outer.y - lift, outer.width, outer.height + extra))

